// Teaches the idea of how images, speech and video become numbers a model can use. It claims nothing about how any named product does it,
// states no sizes, prices, benchmarks or release facts, and has no version notes. Analogies are labelled. All people, shops, photos,
// recordings and numbers in the examples are invented. No code anywhere.

